		{"id":"0c0ffbd85f1260e0","type":"text","text":"Long after the Ascencion of The Raven Queen wizards and arcanists a like began to increase in both power and numbers around the world. As a result of the Dreamers Hearts existence and the arcane disturbance left behind during her ascension. Very far north of the current city Volstar is a mountain range known now as Mageia Ereipia a settlement  was beginning to form of arcanists who wanted to harness this new power that is circulating around the world of Villatos and so begins the Rise of the city of Armount.","x":-260,"y":-60,"width":545,"height":230},
